   "resumo_en": "Heavy Metal Maniac is the debut studio album by the Canadian speed metal band Exciter, released through Shrapnel Records in 1983. The album was reissued by Megaforce Records in 2005.\nAllMusic stated that while the album is more stylistically \"one-dimensional\" than similar albums from the era such as Kill 'Em All, this was much less apparent to listeners and critics at the time of its release.\nHeavy Metal Maniac was inducted into the Decibel Magazine Hall of Fame in a special issue regarding the Top 100 Old-School Metal Albums of All Time.",
